              <h3>Microfluidic Lab-on-Chip for ctDNA Detection</h3>
              <div class="org">Prometheus Research Department</div>
              <ul>
                <li>Designed a four-stage PCR-free architecture for colorectal cancer diagnostics: inertial spiral separator for cell depletion, functionalized magnetic nanoparticle capture, magnetophoretic mixing, and fluorometric quantification.</li>
